                  "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/agents-course/blob/b3946b1d09d29c65736e219d48a8a736a2c52154/units/en/unit1/agent-steps-and-structure.mdx"
                },
                {
                  "id": "ref-3",
                  "title": "深入理解 AI Agent · 模型、运行层与环境",
                  "url": "https://github.com/bojieli/ai-agent-book/blob/b789c97a8f3de5b405a6f6dfa8289208d679d0b8/book/chapter1.md"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "check": {
          "blocks": [
